      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "<h1>Important</h1>\n<p>The <code>config.jsonc</code> from version 1.0.0 is <strong>not</strong> compatible with this version. You will have to re-input your custom values into the new config file supplied with this release.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Added new insurance price override categories for armored and unarmored versions of rigs, face covers and headwear (helmets/hats). Previously, all armored and unarmored items of these types were grouped together.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added config file versioning, so the use of old/unsupported config files with newer mod versions will warn the user at server start.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
